class_name ScoreSuite
extends RefCounted
## The scorecard's plan and outputs (v0.5.0 SCD), shared by scripts/sims/scorecard.gd (the command) and
## tests/unit/sims/test_scorecard.gd (quick mode, in process). A task is "<policy>:<build>[@<skill>]#<seed>"; each
## plays one ScoreRun. The aggregate is every SCORECARD §2 cell (ScoreCells) written as scorecard.json (keys sorted,
## no wall time) and scorecard.md; wall times go to timings.tsv only.

